], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Spatial Camera: Capture in Immersive 3D", "keywords": ["camera", "recorder", "3d", "immersive", "stereoscopic"], "long_description": "# Spatial Camera\n\nExperience your memories in a whole new dimension.\n\nWith **Spatial Camera**, you can capture, save, and relive your moments in stunning 3D stereo. Using your Meta Quest, the app records both **stereoscopic videos** and **stereo photos**, bringing depth and realism that standard cameras simply can\u2019t achieve.\n\n## Key Features\n\n* \ud83c\udfa5 **Record in 3D** \u2013 Capture videos that feel alive with depth.\n* \ud83d\udcf8 **Take 3D Photos** \u2013 Preserve stills in true stereoscopic form.\n* \ud83d\udcc2 **Save to Gallery** \u2013 Export photos and videos directly to your native gallery.\n* \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f **Built-in Viewer** \u2013 Watch your captures instantly in immersive 3D.\n* \ud83d\udd04 **Simple & Intuitive** \u2013 Designed for easy recording, browsing, and sharing.\n\nWhether you\u2019re recording everyday memories, documenting travel adventures, or saving once-in-a-lifetime experiences, Spatial Camera gives you the power to relive them with a sense of presence that 2D media cannot match.\n\nStep into your memories. With Spatial Camera, your moments aren\u2019t just captured\u2014they\u2019re *experienced*.\n\n---\n", "short_description": "Spatial Camera lets you capture your world in true 3D. Record stereoscopic photos and videos with depth, save them to your native gallery, or explore them inside the built-in immersive viewer. Relive memories like never before, whether it\u2019s daily moments or special events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ocutech.dev/sptcpp.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://ocutech.dev/sptcpp.html", "publisher_name": "OcuTech LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ocutech.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFOR